      ],
      "text": "The SandboxRunner lifecycle resolves the agent, merges config, collects forwarded env vars, creates a snapshot, starts the VM, runs an interactive SSH session, stops the VM, diffs, reviews per-file, flushes accepted changes, and cleans up."
    },
