      ],
      "text": "Snapshot mode uses FICLONE (Linux) or clonefile (macOS) for copy-on-write cloning, SHA-256 based diffing with unified diffs, hash re-verification on flush to prevent TOCTOU, and the VM is stopped before review begins."
