      ],
      "text": "Brood Box depends on stacklok/go-microvm as a tagged module (e.g. v0.0.16); task build downloads pre-built go-microvm runtime artifacts and embeds them into a self-contained pure-Go bbox binary, while libkrunfw firmware is downloaded at runtime and cached."
